  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Create the equivalent of a multi-step submission process ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "to get objects into the repository. Do this in as general ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "a manner, so that it is not fused into the base server ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "software. Maybe this can be a plug-in service to ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fedora?",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Date: 2005-03-24 11:48",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Sender: payette",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Logged In: YES ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "user_id=128",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fedora-IR deals with this requirement",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
